  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given truth table represents OR gate.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/26b8b872-4687-4cdf-8409-0b4fa4a202ab-image.png\" style=\"width: 160px; height: 84px;\" /></p><p>Its boolean algebra is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi></math>,&nbsp;where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> are input and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Y</mi></math> is output.</p><p>OR&nbsp;gate gives output <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> if any one of its input is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
